    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cozy pixel-life farming adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is a farm leisure game where players can develop a farm to obtain various basic raw materials, make the forest town more prosperous; and through interactions with the town residents, unlock more functions and plots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate wilderness into fertile land, grow diverse crops, and reap the rewards of your agricultural efforts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446130/extras/1dd1806f1178ea4fd8c40c1b4ef4ee20.poster.avif?t=1751620965\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446130/extras/1dd1806f1178ea4fd8c40c1b4ef4ee20.webm?t=1751620965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446130/extras/1dd1806f1178ea4fd8c40c1b4ef4ee20.mp4?t=1751620965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446130/extras/8dc79126eddc5671e703c905ecb7040f.poster.avif?t=1751620965\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446130/extras/8dc79126eddc5671e703c905ecb7040f.webm?t=1751620965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446130/extras/8dc79126eddc5671e703c905ecb7040f.mp4?t=1751620965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u0